{"job_id":"F-bdcf184b47513f046c4a","family_id":"F-bdcf184b47513f046c4a","title":"군검찰단의 조직에 관한 규정","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002965-241419-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":15,"target_id":"988277479e8d7e5b159c0ca2d2f5022f3b206eef7a4a8557ae60825bc18db684","source_hash":"c8f5807824bbfc56b12e17799ebf2ebd8451bb0cef0ee3c1f29f310a134f1c30","text":"关于军事检察机关组织结构的规定"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002965-241419-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":77,"target_id":"3e76be26222430cf291ee0f76bcf7c6bcf9f477a77190306f472e8adec9e6146","source_hash":"9584ad15ba45e800cabbb52b64b52e75c7fb2132b8463c7b65fa70b0b4134bed","text":"第一条（目的）本法令的目的是根据《军事法院法》第三十六条第八款，规定国防部检察机关和各军种检察机关的组织事项。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002965-241419-ko","scope":"BODY","start":77,"end":300,"target_id":"ac0250750d4a60c93db9762941b45537146e34f880ddefcfc4d1aa60976062b0","source_hash":"dfc80dfd86a7d2fbadb14b7d8524ea3c98daf65a60e4dd45bd07c5e3b85ce765","text":"第二条（国防部检察院）\n① 根据《军事法庭法》（以下简称“本法”）第三十六条第一款设立的国防部检察兵团（以下简称“国防部检察兵团”）对国防部下属的军事检察官和军事检察事务具有管辖权。\n国防部检察院将设有高级检察部、普通检察部、人权保护监督员和事务办公室。\n③ 除第1款和第2款规定的事项外，国防部检察机关的组织、管辖、职责划分等事项，由国防部长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002965-241419-ko","scope":"BODY","start":300,"end":492,"target_id":"2b85323bcfc6fcd1e6c49544c6f170a167f5740ca14dd9f159a6bc378df90f40","source_hash":"dc44315a136983e0e8f0410d33462128909869371637bd198065eb0127e0654a","text":"第三条（国防部检察院院长）\n① 国防部检察院院长根据本法第三十六条第三款由国防部长任命（以下简称“国防部检察院院长”），奉国防部长之命，监督其管辖范围内的事务，指挥、监督其管辖范围内的军事检察官。\n② 如果国防部检察机关机关长职位空缺或者由于不可避免的情况无法履行职责，则由高级总检察长和高级军事检察长代为履行职责。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002965-241419-ko","scope":"BODY","start":492,"end":697,"target_id":"46f6fa048e152df3a4b44fbcf13ad16ce15256faa8a1e89cf2352df8dbaec700","source_hash":"430c71d3212ae6dc0b0eb6790aac6e601d619dafc02ded03b604c74f4b932411","text":"第四条（各军种检察机关）\n① 根据本法第三十六条第一款设立的各军种参谋长下属检察机关（以下简称“各军事检察机关”）对本军种的军事检察官和军事检察机关事务具有管辖权。\n② 每个军事检控单位应设高级检控部门、普通检控部门和人权保护监督员。\n③ 除第1款和第2款规定的事项外，各军种检察机关的组织、管辖和职责划分等事项，由各军种参谋长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002965-241419-ko","scope":"BODY","start":697,"end":918,"target_id":"eba71bea3a3c2413bde7e8325b33bc7781aaaeaddcdec1789725299c6d3b40c2","source_hash":"1e205bf8da3a0d71270b3c502005fb7ce8ff79d14158a7690585a1de26212405","text":"第五条（各军种总检察长）\n① 每个军事检察单位应当设立一名首席检察官（以下简称“首席检察官”），首席检察官应当从军士长以上军衔的军事法律官员中选拔。\n各军事检察机关的负责人应按照各军种参谋长的命令，监督其管辖范围内的事务，并指挥和监督其管辖范围内的军事检察官。\n③ 各军种首席检察官缺席或因不可抗力无法履行职责时，由高级首席检察官和高级军事检察官代为履行职责。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002965-241419-ko","scope":"BODY","start":918,"end":998,"target_id":"cea8dcead142c0bfdfd384d9ef23e0bf80a615920ca2285e12c63064bbca9295","source_hash":"78a80bf508f49470d051a03dcc8ad3151867f31bbb6cf1989c45bce16cd8fb87","text":"第六条（军事检察官等的配额）\n① 军事检察官的核定人数为105人。\n② 国防部检察厅及各军种检察厅的军事检察官职级及人数如下表所示。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002965-241419-ko","scope":"BODY","start":998,"end":1022,"target_id":"b09217bb71b8ba033202f48dd5405d3c23d6df044309b86bac343d504ee0e2aa","source_hash":"55a998d74493893a3a776fb5fa401a0a21e3b5d089071885a1611e5c34403ad8","text":"补充规定 <第32530号，2022年3月11日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002965-241419-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1022,"end":1057,"target_id":"4aa83d7581df8e087c87134215f49387adf71c59a5bfeff53d8fad7ad12f008a","source_hash":"e5d73d8c2529f99a09df50bc402ec089899fa697917bf03690cbe64686f18ff6","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自2022年7月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002965-241419-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1057,"end":2102,"target_id":"14da232a5a7875f5d711e745cb5c30b0319da608f8b06a28842e150c12924992","source_hash":"025346383ef947ec46b085510d5f94009e55fc23502ba79180cc823ebc2ed5e9","text":"第二条（与其他法律法规的关系）在本法令生效时，其他法律法规提及以前的《军事检察机关组织条例》或其相关规定，而本法令中也有相应规定，则视为以本法令或本法令的相关规定代替以前的《军事检察机关组织条例》或其相关规定。\n\n国防部检察机关和各军种检察机关委派的军事检察官的职级和人数（与第六条第二款有关）\n■ 关于军事检察机关组织的规定[附件]                                     \n\n  国防部检察院和各军种检察院军事检察官的职级和人数（与第六条第二款有关）   \n\n  （单位：人）                                                                \n\n┌──────┬───┬───┬─────┬─────┬─────────┐\n\n│军衔分类 │准将 │上校 │中校·少校 │上尉及以下 │总计 │\n\n├──────┼───┼───┼─────┼─────┼─────────┤\n\n│国防部检察厅│1 │1 │8 │6 │16 │\n\n├──────┼───┼───┼─────┼─────┼─────────┤\n\n│陆军检察院│·│2│28│17│47│\n\n├──────┼───┼───┼─────┼─────┼─────────┤\n\n│海军检察厅│·│1│6│16│23│\n\n├──────┼───┼───┼─────┼─────┼─────────┤\n\n│空军检察官办公室│·│1│9│9│19│\n\n├──────┼───┼───┼─────┼─────┼─────────┤\n\n│总计 │1 │5 │51 │48 │105 │\n\n└──────┴───┴───┴─────┴─────┴─────────┘"},{"id":"A28562-zh-00001","doc":"A28562","law_id":"kr-002965-241419-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2034204","source_hash":"d15b9d669ce4f6e39c4909fefe13e7550d87008aecfc377f668dbe409994a88f","text":"■ 关于军事检察机关组织的规定 [附件]"},{"id":"A28562-zh-00002","doc":"A28562","law_id":"kr-002965-241419-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2034205","source_hash":"3a9c99f0d738910c309a5599e739b4d63038130789316ff92deff2729f5823cd","text":"国防部检察机关和各军种检察机关委派的军事检察官的职级和人数（与第六条第二款有关）"},{"id":"A28562-zh-00003","doc":"A28562","law_id":"kr-002965-241419-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2034206","source_hash":"2a60897a328d7d0eb74922f79ab08088893d32e959713c002ac2d89cdeac21a5","text":"(单位：人)"},{"id":"A28562-zh-00004","doc":"A28562","law_id":"kr-002965-241419-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2034209","source_hash":"5b288abb4c71d11f1f3aaeb78be6d5edc4b109563e0e9661de173a7ba81c1620","text":"准将"},{"id":"A28562-zh-00005","doc":"A28562","law_id":"kr-002965-241419-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2034210","source_hash":"691fa5de91f6c719622cd545db09d9d5361a72bdd9fc2723f503f1303ce7aa44","text":"上校"},{"id":"A28562-zh-00006","doc":"A28562","law_id":"kr-002965-241419-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2034211","source_hash":"8e0d13fba40fcee66e27a6c4b75b2ea603efc12aaf28d63f7597343b22af8baf","text":"中校 · 少校"},{"id":"A28562-zh-00007","doc":"A28562","law_id":"kr-002965-241419-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2034212","source_hash":"a0e8ea86d600f3a14d73df519f15074b03a9864ba3f43703d3f61c22769e2dd0","text":"队长或下级"},{"id":"A28562-zh-00008","doc":"A28562","law_id":"kr-002965-241419-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2034214","source_hash":"ce988ed5fc83088f4764b06ee309182e07254bfd817663800c3d958602206feb","text":"国防部检察院"},{"id":"A28562-zh-00009","doc":"A28562","law_id":"kr-002965-241419-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2034215","source_hash":"6b86b273ff34fce19d6b804eff5a3f5747ada4eaa22f1d49c01e52ddb7875b4b","text":"1"},{"id":"A28562-zh-00010","doc":"A28562","law_id":"kr-002965-241419-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2034216","source_hash":"6b86b273ff34fce19d6b804eff5a3f5747ada4eaa22f1d49c01e52ddb7875b4b","text":"1"},{"id":"A28562-zh-00011","doc":"A28562","law_id":"kr-002965-241419-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2034217","source_hash":"2c624232cdd221771294dfbb310aca000a0df6ac8b66b696d90ef06fdefb64a3","text":"8"},{"id":"A28562-zh-00012","doc":"A28562","law_id":"kr-002965-241419-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2034218","source_hash":"e7f6c011776e8db7cd330b54174fd76f7d0216b612387a5ffcfb81e6f0919683","text":"6"},{"id":"A28562-zh-00013","doc":"A28562","law_id":"kr-002965-241419-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2034219","source_hash":"b17ef6d19c7a5b1ee83b907c595526dcb1eb06db8227d650d5dda0a9f4ce8cd9","text":"16"},{"id":"A28562-zh-00014","doc":"A28562","law_id":"kr-002965-241419-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2034220","source_hash":"f297e02f81a4ab0ed5f6335480981e4fcb3be32abb9fb18e5f0e2dadc44c50a4","text":"陆军检察官办公室"},{"id":"A28562-zh-00015","doc":"A28562","law_id":"kr-002965-241419-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2034221","source_hash":"d4735e3